* text=auto

## Enforce text mode and LF line breaks
*.dm text eol=lf whitespace=indent-with-non-tab
*.dme text eol=lf
*.dmp text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

## items.dm holds the "Station Blueprint" ASCII art: a multi-line string whose lines start with spaces.
## Those spaces are part of the string, so changing them would change the compiled .dmb (no longer bit-perfect).
## Turn off the space-indent check for this file so git doesn't flag the art as whitespace errors.
items.dm whitespace=-indent-with-non-tab
